{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/01/5705555/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂上がりでほっぺが赤くて\nチークしてるみたい(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぴんちーちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛乾かすと\n前髪の長さがよく分かる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し長め。\n目にかかるくらい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は起きたらお昼の1:30でした笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんにもう起きな！と言われて\n起きたので、本当はまだまだ寝れたかも..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予想通り、ゆっくり寝れた(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！ChihAnswer！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/01/5705555/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"yuさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・和菓子派？洋菓子派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→断然洋菓子派です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、きな粉、黒蜜、餡子、黒糖が\nあまり食べられなくて...( ;o; )\n白玉や抹茶、みたらしやお餅系は\n好きなんだけど(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洋菓子の中では濃厚なチョコレートが\n大好き！！\nとろ〜っとしたチョコが出てくる\nフォンダンショコラがたまらない♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/01/5705555/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コウキーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・欲望のリインカネーションの時にしていた黒い目隠し的なやつはちゃんと前は見えてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→あれは布ではなくて、\n黒いレースでできているから\nレースの隙間から見えてるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもきつく結びすぎると\n目がきゅっとなって見えづらかったり\nレースが捻じれたり折れて重なったりすると\n見えなくなったりもしてた( ˙³˙)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構慣れるまで大変でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カッコよくて少しセクシーだから\n私は好きだった(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/01/5705555/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三人娘のパパさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちはるさんが思う、中3組の長女、次女、三女は誰？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→長女: ひめ\n次女: 私\n三女: いくちゃん\nの気がする(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめはいくちゃんのお世話をしてくれるし\n凄くしっかり者だから！\n私は自由奔放に生きてる(つもり)！\nいくちゃんはいつも誰かに甘えてるから！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/01/5705555/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやじさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・お寿司屋さんで働いてるのですが、ちはるさんが好きな魚やネタは何か教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→赤貝のひもが好き！\n(ちょっと渋め？)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくらが好き！\n(子供の頃から変わらずに。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"穴子が好き！\n(甘いタレと一緒に食べるのがたまらない。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後は基本的に白身魚が好きですね〜\nマグロやトロも好きだけど♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/01/5705555/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エイさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんの撮る空の写真がどれも大好き！待ち受けにしてもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→わ〜！！嬉しい( ;o; )\nありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勿論です\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/01/5705555/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日目のライブ直前に撮った\n晴れた空をよかったら(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は少なめでゴメンね(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日特別に！\n今日の続きのChihAnswerするので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また楽しみにしててくれたら嬉しいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/01/5705555/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にやにやの私と\n真顔のまいちゅん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「さくらのうた」KANA-BOONさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漢字の、桜の詩とは別の曲。\nとても歌詞がいい。\n懐かしくて甘酸っぱい、\n少し切ない青春の歌詞！\n胸がきゅんとする。\n声が胸に響いてくる！\n好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのコメント読んでいると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもライブが楽しかった。\n最高だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってコメントが沢山あって\n元気になりました(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}